{"id":"40c48b63a76bb8b8ed8fa3032eedebdc16ceae3bab80ee9db05c640ddef0e020","at":"2026-10-27T06:15:13Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["45aa8f21f5a4783c18b96aefb095932817b7b47718a7bbd65ba390f04fbc055c"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.PlugTest: log_out revokes the session and tells its open pages","hash":"077fe539"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/02-plugs.md#plug-log-out","hash":"07feb3ba"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"after log_out the token fetch is {:error, :invalid}, the subscriber receives {:sessions_revoked, [id]} with the session's id, and the response is status 302 to \"/login\"","basis":"review"}
{"id":"80d5228cb9681d40dbeddc4be52e8a41dd7557c89d766d5c6d7622a9459244f3","at":"2026-10-27T06:15:15Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["d5e3843f03d258f7b9b4146bb1ca89f9943993b079a19965592b0e6fe6dc63d2"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.PlugTest: the remember cookie: the cookie is secure exactly when the request is https","hash":"a75e10c2"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/02-plugs.md#plug-remember-secure","hash":"4bee5313"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"log_in(remember: true) over scheme :https asserts the cookie's secure true; the same over :http asserts secure false","basis":"review"}
{"id":"bc5f410c0dedaeab1b6e1a6eaa5949ed22776326fe7129a352e7b7b303ae6f5d","at":"2026-10-27T06:15:17Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["d5c5d3bcaceba7ad41e7833b5e4b0cf63f9989f5299647678a65f666054d8c23"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.PlugTest: the remember cookie: no touch, no cookie sent, or another session's cookie: the cookie is left alone","hash":"649fbf15"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/02-plugs.md#plug-remember-no-touch","hash":"93704749"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"three requests answer with no remember cookie: a remembered session not aged (no touch), an aged session whose browser sent no cookie, and an aged session whose browser's cookie holds another session's token","basis":"review"}
{"id":"b36037262b4e10bf49a4bf079f25d3a4878d0ce1b9811fd05a841c7a8a1b7adc","at":"2026-10-27T06:15:19Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["72cf951a2d99126442bd3f7fa5aac48a7f9f0eb972d1ebc55b93d216581f00ee"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.PlugTest: the remember cookie: the cookie's name is configurable, by default _macaw_auth_remember","hash":"36380cd6"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/02-plugs.md#plug-remember-name","hash":"978840b9"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"unconfigured remember_cookie/0 is \"_macaw_auth_remember\"; with \"_my_app_remember\" log_in sets that cookie and not the default, and the next request is signed in from it","basis":"review"}
{"id":"56eca6187a6dbb1e10458e665056ccda1dd215481454a84a0631fad73551cecb","at":"2026-10-27T06:15:21Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["215a4b75219f196b679ce0a1107a90fbd69bbca8e0365d2d40ad9581047f1afd"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.PlugTest: the token is read from the session key token_key/0 names","hash":"67e56c47"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/02-plugs.md#plug-token-key","hash":"488d3ee8"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"token_key/0 is \"macaw_auth_token\"; a live token under that key signs the request in, the same token under another key doesn't","basis":"review"}
{"id":"cc8a155523858b1a5e9b58e00b54aff33619c0aa27c6aab1d36872658507c2b7","at":"2026-10-27T06:15:24Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["5db7dfd81e16077c5a89905fb82d172718a2ede7d69b29362802ea675a92dd4f"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.PlugTest: a live token assigns its user and session; a revoked one three nils, and loses the token","hash":"b35df486"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/02-plugs.md#plug-fetch","hash":"5f4c4f1f"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"a live token assigns the user, the session and a nil pending step; after revoke the same token assigns nil, nil, nil and \"macaw_auth_token\" is gone from the session","basis":"review"}
