{"id":"bbe00ebfe035b7003bb565de6d6c186d41d5d285c9a00e4fbda23555aad9ed03","at":"2026-10-27T06:15:49Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["45ee309ea28bd6de0a0718ed84be7224d46d2366a7320024c09190e37534547b"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.PlugTest: the sections of spec 02: log_out renews and clears the session, and with no session or cookie still goes to sign in","hash":"6279fc0c"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/02-plugs.md#auth-plug-log-in","hash":"4459b78e"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"§7 log_out: the session is renewed and emptied, the response is a halted 302 to \"/login\", no remember cookie is deleted when none was sent, and a signed-out log_out also goes to sign in","basis":"review"}
{"id":"c65e8832e36a0f1643f0691d75fb247d6b20e0e288d8f2d642800fd7c8efcae7","at":"2026-10-27T06:15:49Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["75abe9ae8cd49e5d25c848ab403d7ed9a7d953ed65502bc9815f1e780459392d"],"op":"relate","type":"implements","ends":[{"kind":"code","id":"Macaw.Auth.Plug.log_out/1","hash":"1d04746c"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/02-plugs.md#auth-plug-log-in","hash":"4459b78e"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"§7 log_out: the session is renewed and emptied, the response is a halted 302 to \"/login\", no remember cookie is deleted when none was sent, and a signed-out log_out also goes to sign in","basis":"review"}
{"id":"2ec9cbba1f9eed2cedb5ab647ce054ad9486123c45a98e4863d47d51626b9f47","at":"2026-10-27T06:15:51Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["f88c4da6fbad421efe01da47871c2c3f83a38ca2699caa903c8858010e428640"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.PlugTest: the sections of spec 02: continue: the owed step, else the return path (then forgotten), else home","hash":"08035ddd"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/02-plugs.md#auth-plug-continue","hash":"318b269c"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"§7.1: continue/1 sends a session owing :second_factor to its page over a return path; without a step to the remembered \"/reports\", deleting it from the session; without either, home; each halted","basis":"review"}
{"id":"b447ce0a7543c46e909c44cd1c22ecc498f70aa9a74d8debf9c33ff47730e5a2","at":"2026-10-27T06:15:51Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["2efe23c8299f486cc6a9204bbcb7e0a50a59aab05cb43d16c57486008b3d8cd2"],"op":"relate","type":"implements","ends":[{"kind":"code","id":"Macaw.Auth.Plug.continue/1","hash":"0b7736f1"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/02-plugs.md#auth-plug-continue","hash":"318b269c"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"§7.1: continue/1 sends a session owing :second_factor to its page over a return path; without a step to the remembered \"/reports\", deleting it from the session; without either, home; each halted","basis":"review"}
{"id":"5f136de5f784d58f560f87a7e2e4dc9c6e757fc1b13613fad19f7fec6d5e718a","at":"2026-10-27T06:15:54Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["f0650baad5540cfef3e7f9e04380d3b60ebf7f0967faf7e2eec0889f7b7c2852"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.PlugTest: the sections of spec 02: complete_step re-reads the session and goes on; a session that no longer resolves is logged out","hash":"5bed3215"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/02-plugs.md#auth-plug-complete-step","hash":"39d5b819"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"§7.2: complete_step(:password_change) reassigns the re-read session (completed_steps [:password_change]) and nil pending step and continues to \"/reports\"; a step recorded for a session whose user was disabled meanwhile is logged out to \"/login\", no token kept","basis":"review"}
{"id":"c8dfa30806f2327921f4dbea7ab889c854ce2927e8dc240616f460416d62e8af","at":"2026-10-27T06:15:54Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["953c5fdad0fc33632be349a49ba4ced85ed99e36d2b8b8fbbb9df6cde746a465"],"op":"relate","type":"implements","ends":[{"kind":"code","id":"Macaw.Auth.Plug.complete_step/2","hash":"96719da1"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/02-plugs.md#auth-plug-complete-step","hash":"39d5b819"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"§7.2: complete_step(:password_change) reassigns the re-read session (completed_steps [:password_change]) and nil pending step and continues to \"/reports\"; a step recorded for a session whose user was disabled meanwhile is logged out to \"/login\", no token kept","basis":"review"}
{"id":"f7970c2b519bfa0762ecc4262dbc557ce89913845df80eae374a83c5641a40ad","at":"2026-10-27T06:15:56Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["372a84c509c3b62a947a01ddb01b5bbb49a7c932deb3abc560c48f298000cd62"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.PlugNativeTest: the sections of spec 02: verify_second_factor/2: accepted, on to the next step; refused, the conn unchanged; throttled by the conn's address","hash":"cc851b43"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/02-plugs.md#auth-plug-verify","hash":"18406ab0"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"§8 with the native backend: a wrong code gives {:error, :invalid_code, conn} with the same conn; a right code gives {:ok, conn} halted 302 to the next step \"/password\"; five wrong codes from one conn address make a sixth user's right code {:error, :throttled, conn}, so the conn's address reaches the throttle","basis":"review"}
{"id":"d3dad4e10546af7af2bf0425667b4cbc0aec06bbcd5ccc78729e84efd2182c01","at":"2026-10-27T06:15:56Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["e11a9b064e2cfd3eb7716a8eb8815935f71a91cc05da0b74221c7615b577537a"],"op":"relate","type":"implements","ends":[{"kind":"code","id":"Macaw.Auth.Plug.verify_second_factor/2","hash":"35692f82"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/02-plugs.md#auth-plug-verify","hash":"18406ab0"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"§8 with the native backend: a wrong code gives {:error, :invalid_code, conn} with the same conn; a right code gives {:ok, conn} halted 302 to the next step \"/password\"; five wrong codes from one conn address make a sixth user's right code {:error, :throttled, conn}, so the conn's address reaches the throttle","basis":"review"}
{"id":"9c796dc18834f8aa5f9397e9471fc54ba28d6b2462363fbc5b5536e24a5bc5cf","at":"2026-10-27T06:15:58Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["e764c9d16705e79fd8159488d2cfb3b0492da8ae7a81a0e8b116f8636461a8c0"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.PlugTest: the sections of spec 02: site_path? is one leading slash and none of the unsafe sequences; every redirect is a halted 302","hash":"116ce70b"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/02-plugs.md#auth-plug-site-path","hash":"8dd93e4c"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"§9: site_path? is true for plain site paths and false for \"//\", a backslash, \"/%09\", \"/\" plus tab, a line feed, a carriage return, a URL, \"x\" and \"\"; require_authenticated, require_role, redirect_if_signed_in, continue and log_out each answer a halted 302 to a site path","basis":"review"}
{"id":"86ad18531045cc6e013d9bdb5c526ec28f6613420c212a0cfe31fa9bd9f32c5a","at":"2026-10-27T06:15:58Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["0d50911ba5ce34fd06ffad41faaa6d15a55d1fbfd0d6806a003587613b3fbf76"],"op":"relate","type":"implements","ends":[{"kind":"code","id":"Macaw.Auth.Plug.site_path?/1","hash":"bf48fffe"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/02-plugs.md#auth-plug-site-path","hash":"8dd93e4c"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"§9: site_path? is true for plain site paths and false for \"//\", a backslash, \"/%09\", \"/\" plus tab, a line feed, a carriage return, a URL, \"x\" and \"\"; require_authenticated, require_role, redirect_if_signed_in, continue and log_out each answer a halted 302 to a site path","basis":"review"}
{"id":"e5d266808da4626300e3f855a0712e69e343dd3f46bb0cf886326bee5c9c3f1a","at":"2026-10-27T06:16:01Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["53b6cea889e34097acc0594c6ec47aa72f01145b3610e88caf7e8bcd9a4f6666"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.PlugTest: the sections of spec 02: remembered, a browser stays signed in after it closes; not remembered, it doesn't","hash":"6e21dd70"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/02-plugs.md#auth-plug-remember","hash":"0d9683a4"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"§10: after log_in(remember: true) a later request with an empty session is signed in as the user; after log_in without it no cookie is set and the later request is signed out","basis":"review"}
{"id":"74a434049aca62e4f309249acf2c25cfbbc49630642d43570a635cade5295683","at":"2026-10-27T06:16:03Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["41cb492404a721225abe79a37261fac92d63493e43bc2438588d692b0dec0951"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.PlugTest: the sections of spec 02: the cookie never holds the bare token, and an altered one is ignored as absent","hash":"d312b35a"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/02-plugs.md#auth-plug-remember-cookie","hash":"552782c9"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"§10.1: the cookie's value is neither the token nor its Base64; the signed value with a character inside its signature changed signs nobody in and puts no token in the session","basis":"review"}
{"id":"c76214639a1adac92e24c70606ef320be9cfa7de039681b1e0f43730bf0629d2","at":"2026-10-27T06:16:05Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["ff02d3187e62e6a210b3b9a044108c0d5092fe9afcb7b519c9a4a040b20abd87"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.PlugTest: the sections of spec 02: a restored session is renewed and its cookie set again; a refused one's cookie is deleted","hash":"1ed312ab"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/02-plugs.md#auth-plug-remember-read","hash":"baaa4a07"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"§10.2: a restore renews the session (plug_session_info :renew) and sets the cookie again with max_age the idle limit holding the same token; a disabled user's cookie signs nobody in and is deleted (max_age 0); no cookie, signed out with no cookie set","basis":"review"}
{"id":"b4d1af0d9b50f9282cafe2f6a54bb23bc404b087045a0264b60c5eae48955394","at":"2026-10-27T06:16:07Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["321c61be4a43f294714fb0ce401d6038600f8f5633bbf04dd78d9c2fee27b392"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.PlugTest: the sections of spec 02: the library sets no cookie but its own, secure by the request's scheme alone","hash":"b1a2ee71"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/02-plugs.md#auth-plug-secure","hash":"294ab576"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"§10.3: log_in(remember: true) over https and http sets exactly one response cookie, the remember cookie (the session cookie is the host's), secure true over https and false over http","basis":"review"}
{"id":"cdd9a33e69de9a2f6297844f4d42307ae7098582d3f5a5f19ab7e17cbbbeb7e9","at":"2026-10-27T06:16:10Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["9fedf4964b874a260af61a57231d653ad8f194edaf80d1da704f6507e934b9b8"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.LiveTest: :mount_current_user assigns the user and session of a live token, and nil without one","hash":"fa13f288"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/03-live.md#live-mount-user","hash":"441bc545"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"on_mount(:mount_current_user) with a live token is {:cont, s} with current_user.id and current_session.id the token's; with an empty session it is {:cont, s} with both nil","basis":"review"}
{"id":"18eeb2abf4426f2f81cde9b4792ad772f9d9fe9acd8534fd1724eb4edcd71001","at":"2026-10-27T06:16:12Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["2b1afb420ec104623e5c0a85f250b6d45ae1a486b51fd64690e6329026473a99"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.LiveTest: a signed-in session mounts with its user","hash":"6d73a6d3"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/03-live.md#live-require-authenticated","hash":"e7c53bd3"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"on_mount(:require_authenticated) with a live token is {:cont, socket} and both current_user.id and current_session.id (added) are the session's","basis":"review"}
{"id":"3c59cb3cadd93c0e332435741fa07c1f33feda1e52b0d96b53b5451c5bdba53d","at":"2026-10-27T06:16:14Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["aa2a74595bcbb3e70b7b968cec8d93bd6bff3fc751888bdad1bcb95f5ce0d511"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.LiveTest: a missing role is redirected home; a held one mounts","hash":"b0768fae"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/03-live.md#live-require-role","hash":"fa586132"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"{:require_role, [\"admin\"]} for a viewer halts with redirected to \"/\"; for an admin (added) it is {:cont, s} with current_user.id the admin's","basis":"review"}
{"id":"8764410ee2b24e753ae3c69ac07129b0fe8338c3b01cd02d1ffce3e9039d7914","at":"2026-10-27T06:16:16Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["17b9c3ee73522c4c04deb879162ee0bdd96643601e65191ac3acaedf3363fe7f"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.LiveTest: a session owing a step is redirected to the step","hash":"4475307c"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/03-live.md#live-require-step","hash":"d696f915"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"split from the role test: :require_authenticated for an :enrolled user's fresh session (owing :second_factor) halts redirecting to \"/login/second-factor\"","basis":"review"}
{"id":"b77709d1bc723d5d6b2fa2a42d1ea7c34127e6c3d997ed74e2fe4ad06ec01cde","at":"2026-10-27T06:16:18Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["4cd85b488d9de69dc535190aef008221fd4fe42d68819719d4904dc2813b99c1"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.LiveTest: a page's re-checks never move its session's last use","hash":"c55bc460"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/03-live.md#live-recheck-no-touch","hash":"454fd4a3"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"the session is aged 1000 s past the memory backend's 300 s touch interval, then two re-checks run; last_used_at read with touch: false before and after is unchanged","basis":"review"}
{"id":"31d6b60edb6d5e8aa679e634d8391a80584e508c480e6bd0aff40d2e464df3dd","at":"2026-10-27T06:16:21Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["8823ed123793fab8c2533d5023626fef8998040588e8848f3bd55f98cfd38c6b"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.LiveTest: other messages pass through","hash":"198cd0f7"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/03-live.md#live-other-messages","hash":"830d55c7"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"handle_guard(:something_else, s) == {:cont, s}: exactly the same socket, not just a :cont","basis":"review"}
{"id":"231dc16fc30b1761fe912e8a31f420ebf1ccf6979302ce3acb8fb5bfd2710e3b","at":"2026-10-27T06:16:23Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["1ecaca24177d6f492f50f8e47d906596d89c23193497071a72c76cd80627d6e3"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.LiveTest: the sections of spec 03: no mount, by any hook, moves the session's last use; the token is read at token_key/0","hash":"c7856f74"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/03-live.md#auth-live","hash":"50adf486"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"the intro's \"a mount never touches the session\": each of the four hooks mounts an aged session and last_used_at is unchanged after; and the token is read only under Macaw.Auth.Plug.token_key/0 (another key halts)","basis":"review"}
{"id":"cf9d0e7dba073190bfcc2f7ad6e79c6eedf6c7091ae812564600f9bc8053539b","at":"2026-10-27T06:16:23Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["cc12e80ffc854a4d714176803439e55fec551bebac02a32726286fa506086aa2"],"op":"relate","type":"implements","ends":[{"kind":"code","id":"Macaw.Auth.Live","hash":"9c3eed3d"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/03-live.md#auth-live","hash":"50adf486"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"the intro's \"a mount never touches the session\": each of the four hooks mounts an aged session and last_used_at is unchanged after; and the token is read only under Macaw.Auth.Plug.token_key/0 (another key halts)","basis":"review"}
{"id":"9b56cc3a39026b80d84b23fb7b53a97a4fb7eb0823901fbf3fa8b9f9abd579a1","at":"2026-10-27T06:16:25Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["45eda41505f7ab98db937650cdc81257d646ac183dd022969a3435e485976038"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.LiveTest: the sections of spec 03: :mount_current_user never redirects or guards: a refused token or an owed step still continues","hash":"74b424ce"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/03-live.md#auth-live-mount-user","hash":"dc992e5d"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"§1's own claims: a revoked token continues with both nil and no redirect; a session owing :second_factor still continues on a connected socket, unredirected, with no :pending_step assign, no guard hook attached and no re-check scheduled","basis":"review"}
{"id":"c73dcf2d291dd7bcbb6ba07604a6d297cafff5d4ea669c1bf59c4ed1a251cae0","at":"2026-10-27T06:16:27Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["e772617f8fb0cf586985b9de243e05235df70c878345c0f7018fe0a6b46216bf"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.LiveTest: the sections of spec 03: the guards' order, full-page redirects without a flash, and the authorize hook's options","hash":"8c2d6aca"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/03-live.md#auth-live-guarded","hash":"5ace2b52"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"§2's prose: redirects are {:redirect, %{status: 302}}; the step is checked before the role and before the resource function, which is not called for a session owing a step and called once with the params when admitted; refusals go home with an empty flash; an option other than :resource raises ArgumentError","basis":"review"}
{"id":"c4b2391402b0a854bfc06ee329c677dc9b20562467788cff134a0dc3473066e5","at":"2026-10-27T06:16:29Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["eff5a58042a23b32d92d33e72940dc856ea3138c326f9db01e8daf3acf134b3c"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.LiveTest: the sections of spec 03: a connected mount subscribes, schedules the re-check and hooks handle_info; a static one doesn't","hash":"4436c438"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/03-live.md#auth-live-guard","hash":"e82f490d"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"§2.1: a static mount has no lifecycle hook, hears no revocation and gets no re-check; a connected one has handle_info hook :macaw_auth_guard, receives :macaw_auth_recheck after revalidate_ms 10, and receives {:sessions_revoked, [id]}; with revalidate_ms unset no re-check comes within 200 ms","basis":"review"}
{"id":"6f86279c7dbc83db946fe380a67f33acdba5c806be549d503919217c34eebb90","at":"2026-10-27T06:16:31Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["593462a000ca34dab3e2763bb14bf94cb4f96544d51f226024e41568e2b98122"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.LiveTest: the sections of spec 03: a revocation reaches a connected page with no endpoint configured; the page's handle_info never sees it","hash":"51db20d1"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/03-live.md#auth-live-revoked","hash":"9511da16"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"§3: with :endpoint unset, a connected page receives Auth.revoke's {:sessions_revoked, ids}; for another session handle_guard halts (consumed) with no redirect and the page's session kept; for its own it halts redirecting to \"/login\"","basis":"review"}
{"id":"0fac4795064e1f0f717b61879059e2d7b8b023049f5b6410af16bbf57bebb0e7","at":"2026-10-27T06:16:33Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["283682043d139b9e8d252ab15c75727cc832f55133b7e2694918fb565d77e4ca"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.LiveTest: the sections of spec 03: the re-check keeps the mount's guard, reassigns the user, schedules the next, and stops on a redirect","hash":"3978831b"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/03-live.md#auth-live-recheck","hash":"639f6f19"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"§4's prose: private :macaw_auth_guard is :any, {:roles, roles} and {:authorize, :edit, resource}; a kept re-check doesn't call the resource function again, reassigns the renamed user and schedules the next; an expired session goes to \"/login\" with no re-check after; a disabled user's page goes to \"/login\"","basis":"review"}
{"id":"6a75e2ae50260ab9226eab47147abb0980608498596751faa5e0841da7c7bc15","at":"2026-10-27T06:16:35Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["147c34ba0b9f2606cf2b4ff1c76456a9190b5254625784c21e0de6d6cf1808c2"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.LiveTest: the sections of spec 03: any message but the guard's continues untouched to the page","hash":"8ae78524"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/03-live.md#auth-live-other","hash":"3c06206d"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"§5's \"any other message\": four messages of other shapes (a similar tuple, a string, a tuple led by :macaw_auth_recheck, an integer) each give {:cont, s} with the socket unchanged","basis":"review"}
{"id":"9b8332ff347c444948c18e5550c2ce3dd81c7ac1db489acfedcdc59c91753bc8","at":"2026-10-27T06:16:38Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["7e511f3ecb18f3b2caa547bd841bd3f48cffad221a831baf235ca9ddb347f013"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.Native.ConfigTest: the defaults: a password source named local, bcrypt, and the session and TOTP settings","hash":"bc12889c"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/05-native-config.md#native-config-defaults","hash":"a4954394"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"parse([repo]) is matched for the Bcrypt hasher and exactly one Password source named local; session_idle_days 14, totp_issuer \"Macaw\", totp_required false and sealing_key nil are each asserted","basis":"review"}
{"id":"3bae53f664ac6f652173c6ed72bab84b9f3f338b4b37324cf9a76ff5fc89c15f","at":"2026-10-27T06:16:40Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["cf8e44cd0c6a087f09ea0c0445e430a377e2263f7fa4497edc53ef40b252ebca"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.Native.ConfigTest: a source's unknown key, a bad name and a secret reference are checked, by name","hash":"acf776f6"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/06-native-sources.md#source-settings","hash":"ce48e04f"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"asserts the password source's hasher: :x fault, the \"Bad Name\" LDAP name fault prefix, {:env, \"LDAP_PW\"} resolving from the :env option, and the unset variable's exact sources[nas].search.bind_password message","basis":"review"}
