{"id":"a7c0dea0ebbc4c256732948fe625d83bd34773b299268dc87bdb06e919f1ffd9","at":"2026-10-27T06:17:33Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["1ba7730221c8376728f924dac59988a7a7c6b91d1ac88ff059a2323defb03f60"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.NativeTest: the sections of spec 05: while a wait runs: not checked, a hash's time spent, :throttled, and not counted","hash":"dcc98261"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/05-native-config.md#auth-native-throttled","hash":"490bf934"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"after five failures, the right password at 0, 500 and 999 ms is :throttled, each spending no_user_verify and never verify; the wait is still the fifth failure's (delay 1 ms at 999, none at 1000), so throttled attempts weren't counted","basis":"review"}
{"id":"e2dbd812807d39fe59efa075609707692799cfdc18dd4c58a3f5938806cb615b","at":"2026-10-27T06:17:36Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["c9e91e3b3bf6ba20701a6051d384877bd07c6c5f86464de9661e50b3a27886c0"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.NativeTest: the sections of spec 05: every attempt emits one event, its metadata exactly the four keys, never the username","hash":"16c20fd5"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/05-native-config.md#auth-native-telemetry","hash":"40f8691b"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"the event's measurements are %{count: 1}; success metadata has exactly result/reason/source/user_id with the row's id; an unknown user's is exactly %{result: :error, reason: :no_user, source: \"local\", user_id: nil}; a throttled one's has reason :throttled and source nil, without the username, and one attempt emits one event","basis":"review"}
