{"id":"b922841f4e443e5f621b04cc835b91c0033e47b01d7514491c08b3c27087f34b","at":"2026-10-27T06:19:04Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["ad06dd887afea491fb2676c67d7d964e8bf62a719c2c2aa43a386a74bf556a0c"],"op":"relate","type":"implements","ends":[{"kind":"code","id":"Macaw.Auth.Native.Throttle.now/0","hash":"f2170743"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/10-native-throttle.md#auth-throttle-keys","hash":"7095414e"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"10 §1 prose: authenticate with \"Bea \", \"not a name!\" and \"@@\" from a tuple address writes {:user, \"bea\"}, {:user, :invalid} x2 and {:ip, \"192.0.2.70\"} x3; check/3 gives the longer of the two keys' waits; failure/3 counts on both keys at now; now/0 is the system clock in ms","basis":"review"}
{"id":"64caa90d100348f9146d9e2b50bed4ef3ea3d99b581b5426ac9f5d518aa0d945","at":"2026-10-27T06:19:07Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["d0150341c53c0af33e71d338baf151e6c1e9f6f7d37c6aa8bc44158d6419e547"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.Native.ThrottleTest: the sections of spec 10: nothing is locked for good: at the cap, the right password succeeds once the wait passed","hash":"dd8dbb97"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/10-native-throttle.md#auth-throttle-backoff","hash":"6a741958"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"10 §2 prose: after 40 failures the right password is throttled 1 ms before the cap and signs in at the cap; a checked failure after the wait doubles the next wait to 2 000 ms from that failure","basis":"review"}
{"id":"aa87897f179996e7cc5a56cf42bace3508cf00b4ace30c409532fa86071e57fc","at":"2026-10-27T06:19:09Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["fca2e18aed15dec8550113b6dfa8e8b26264331aeead502e30aa119cb088afea"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.Native.ThrottleTest: the sections of spec 10: success/1 forgets the username's key and only it; a sign-in resets the normalized name","hash":"2f89666c"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/10-native-throttle.md#auth-throttle-reset","hash":"a618b055"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"10 §3 prose: success/1 removes {:user, \"gus\"} and leaves the address row; a successful sign-in as \" GUS\" deletes the normalized username key and keeps the address count","basis":"review"}
{"id":"d6c07f7ec4457c37fcf4df7de8e92776ae21169430440d2ee3080b28e166d67b","at":"2026-10-27T06:19:09Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["e7cd9c296fa4312e1df3657123f231bddfc6c2919dc2702002ea48dc59789dfd"],"op":"relate","type":"implements","ends":[{"kind":"code","id":"Macaw.Auth.Native.Throttle.success/1","hash":"efc15d11"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/10-native-throttle.md#auth-throttle-reset","hash":"a618b055"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"10 §3 prose: success/1 removes {:user, \"gus\"} and leaves the address row; a successful sign-in as \" GUS\" deletes the normalized username key and keeps the address count","basis":"review"}
{"id":"8fb354c580930ad336af81bdcfb21924de17f80386f96eeedc4353aaa28fa85f","at":"2026-10-27T06:19:11Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["df32a9ee30997e54ac5cb953b2bb01e3cccb136ee6e43f6d3ef1e36bab9d8e8d"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.Native.ThrottleTest: the sections of spec 10: codes: their own username key, the sign-in's address key, a wrong code counts, others don't","hash":"e5015701"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/10-native-throttle.md#auth-throttle-second-factor","hash":"00f20a97"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"10 §4 prose: a not-started confirmation and a policy-required disable write no row; a wrong code writes {:user, {:second_factor, \"hal\"}} and not {:user, \"hal\"}; an accepted code clears that key but not the address; code failures from an address throttle a sign-in from it and sign-in failures throttle a code from theirs; a blocked code attempt sends no hasher message","basis":"review"}
{"id":"3de28a54b4b280d526955dc69c1a3187db9ccbe84468ba60dea6c2441ccdbbe3","at":"2026-10-27T06:19:13Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["0cf2f336c6fa399a865ec5801957b0c26c11c77854fb11d35a4051ce94128441"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.Native.ThrottleTest: the sections of spec 10: whichever key blocks, a blocked attempt spends one hash's time, as a checked one does","hash":"603dde9b"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/10-native-throttle.md#auth-throttle-timing","hash":"f94fa7f6"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"10 §5 prose: a checked attempt spends one verify; an attempt blocked by the username alone and one blocked by the address alone each spend exactly one no_user_verify and nothing else (counting hasher)","basis":"review"}
{"id":"424c89af7b1e34c8af2793c8ee5677c09ffcf3073656ece3b7a6ad005703d107","at":"2026-10-27T06:19:15Z","commit":"998c0d525899c5ec42dcd994805ea7deb62c6615","parents":["b4b1eefaac74bab6221e5d1a5e1bb553dda3e7004c5090caa33e4ebec13c4415"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.Native.ThrottleTest: the sections of spec 10: a named public table the application's throttle owns, rows {key, failures, last}, reset, and the owner's options","hash":"ffed8a5d"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/10-native-throttle.md#auth-throttle-table","hash":"604b8a5a"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"10 §6 prose: the throttle is Macaw.Auth.Supervisor's worker and owns the named public table; a row is {key, failures, last_ms}; reset/0 empties it; a throttle started with start_link(sweep_every_ms: 10, clock: f) sweeps on its own at f's time, forgetting the two-day-old key and keeping the current one","basis":"review"}
